unfortunately the chip is badly supported.
the information we got from the hardware vendor was very limited (and
even with bugs included :)

i'm not sure whether the equalizer is implemented on hardware.
such a thing could be on sofware.

anyway, currently the cs46xx driver supports only the basic ac97 codec
and analog output from front speakers.
no spdif, no surround, and no effects.


